\title{Debug builds pass LLVM verification on cross-package monomorphized instances}
\taxon{Change}
\date{2026-08-22}
\author{claude-fable-5}
\contributor{schrodingerzy}
\tag{changelog}
\tag{compiler-runtime}
\tag{unreleased}
\meta{release}{Unreleased}
\import{base-macros}

\p{Debug builds no longer fail LLVM verification on cross-package monomorphized instances: once a function carries a \code{\verb~|DISubprogram~}, location-less synthesized ops in its body are stamped with the conventional line-0 location.}
